      "final_answer": "The official care information for the Breeze Tumbler contains two different recommendations:\n\n* **Hand\u2011wash the body, dishwasher\u2011safe lid** \u2013 The product\u2011care guide says the stainless\u2011steel body should be hand\u2011washed, while the lid can go on the top rack of a dishwasher (11-product-care.md \u2014 Breeze Tumbler).\n\n* **All components are dishwasher safe** \u2013 The product card states that every part of the Breeze Tumbler is safe for the dishwasher (top rack recommended) (12-breeze-tumbler-product-card.md \u2014 Cleaning).\n\nBecause these two active, official sources disagree, I can\u2019t give a definitive answer about putting the entire tumbler in the dishwasher. I recommend confirming the correct cleaning method with a member of our support team.",
